// The ONE place the Apple Team ID lives (kosmos #4089, #718).
//
// The Xcode project reads it from here (this file is the app target's base configuration), and
// tools/archive.sh reads it from here for the export.
//
// 864QZ69GF2 is Stone Syndicate LLC, for an interim TestFlight app only (Josh, 2026-10-12, #4089):
// internal testers, under its own bundle id below, instead of waiting on Apple's approval of Kosmos
// Agent Manager, Inc. (#3643). Apple cannot transfer an app never released on the App Store, so the
// real app is created fresh under that org as io.kosmos.app, and both lines here change then.
// Push needs an APNs key from the SAME team as this one (docs/phone-push-go-live.md, Step 1).
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = 864QZ69GF2

// The bundle id the app is built with (the project reads PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER from here, and
// tools/archive.sh checks the exported app against it). io.kosmos.app.preview is the interim
// TestFlight app's; io.kosmos.app is kept untouched for Kosmos Agent Manager, Inc.
KOSMOS_BUNDLE_ID = io.kosmos.app.preview
